DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ffttookk() function attempts to create a unique key suitable for use with
     the msgget(2), semget(2) and shmget(2) functions given the _p_a_t_h of an ex‐
     isting file and a user-selectable _i_d.

